{
  "entry_commit": "7f401fa8",
  "timing_started_only_after_final_validation": true,
  "notes": [
    "Development root failures remain in the ordered source-obligations-*-through.log files; final 79-check validation supersedes them without dropping evidence.",
    "Initial frozen release 343e8be8 and sanitizer 6890cc23 passed 77 groups but did not prove default recipe reuse. Entity::source selected the whole declaration instead of the declarator; final source passes the declarator to default_initialize and asserts M/KM work/use counts.",
    "Initial 242-control harness reused one filename for invalid and valid list returns. The proof verifier detected the overwritten source hash. Initial harness, manifest and failed proof remain; final harness rejects duplicate names and reran both complete 242-control groups with unique sources.",
    "Initial layout helper wrote the destination manifest path. The exact destination manifest was restored from 7f401fa8. The initial new result and helper remain under source-initial names; final layout uses its distinct path.",
    "First preflight rejected zero default recipe uses before timing. Second preflight rejected a new defaulted operator call unsupported by A. The common runtime input uses explicit argument v(2), with the same checked operations, and all 47 compiler/14 native equivalent preflights pass before timing.",
    "Additional true/false conditional branch, lvalue, class construction and cleanup controls ran on final release and sanitizer. All five frozen destination handoffs now reject under both final binaries.",
    "Completed untimed inspection executables alone were losslessly gzip archived to respect the shared 20 GiB ceiling; compiler binaries, timed native images, inputs, observations and logs remain pinned. Manifests retain original/archive hashes and decompression checks. No compression overlapped timing.",
    "A compression attempt refused a lifecycle proof-pinned executable before mutation; the successful retry selected only completed untimed probes not required at their original path by historical proof manifests.",
    "Initial validation and layout are preserved evidence, not final acceptance. No source-obligation timing samples preceded the final frozen campaign or were discarded."
  ],
